        {
            "id": 6642655,
            "title": "英特爾盤中崩跌30%！恐寫史上最慘一天 全球晶片股跟著殺",
            "description": "<main class=\"c1tt5pk2\" id=\"article-container\" style=\"--c1tt5pk2-0:20px\"><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>英特爾(<a data-ga-click-item=\"USS:INTC:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/usstock/detail/INTC\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">INTC-US</a>)周五(30日)盤中重挫30%，恐創歷來最大單日跌幅，市值可能蒸發逾1,460億美元，並引發全球晶片股賣壓。PC需求疲弱、記憶體漲價及AI建設成本攀升，使投資人重新檢視科技業的獲利與現金流前景。</p></section><p><template id=\"P:1\"></template></p><section style=\"margin-top:30px\">\n</section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>根據《路透》報導，英特爾預估單季營收較市場預期低逾10億美元，並警告今年現金流無法轉正。此前，臉書母公司Meta(<a data-ga-click-item=\"USS:META:STOCK:ETF\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/usstock/detail/META\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">META-US</a>)、Google母公司Alphabet(<a data-ga-click-item=\"USS:GOOGL:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/usstock/detail/GOOGL\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">GOOGL-US</a>)(<a data-ga-click-item=\"USS:GOOG:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/usstock/detail/GOOG\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">GOOG-US</a>)財報已凸顯AI支出與舉債壓力；亞馬遜(<a data-ga-click-item=\"USS:AMZN:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/usstock/detail/AMZN\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">AMZN-US</a>)則公布龐大現金流出，並預告明年資本支出將進一步增加。</p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\">\n</section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><h6>股債同步承壓 賣壓擴散全球</h6></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\">\n</section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>美國政府去年8月取得英特爾10%股權，成為最大股東，此次跌勢恐使其持股價值縮水近120億美元。信用市場也響起警訊，英特爾五年期信用違約交換(CDS)利差擴大17.5個基點至124.75個基點，創歷史新高，單日升幅可能為2022年10月以來最大。</p></section><div class=\"i1y9ycug\"></div><section style=\"margin-top:30px\">\n</section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>不過，美國政府與輝達(<a data-ga-click-item=\"USS:NVDA:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/usstock/detail/NVDA\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">NVDA-US</a>)的投資已強化英特爾財務。截至9月底，公司持有現金及約當現金218.4億美元，長期債務則為463.2億美元。</p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\">\n</section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>超微(<a data-ga-click-item=\"USS:AMD:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/usstock/detail/AMD\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">AMD-US</a>)、安謀(<a data-ga-click-item=\"USS:ARM:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/usstock/detail/ARM\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">ARM-US</a>)、高通(<a data-ga-click-item=\"USS:QCOM:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/usstock/detail/QCOM\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">QCOM-US</a>)、輝達、博通(<a data-ga-click-item=\"USS:AVGO:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/usstock/detail/AVGO\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">AVGO-US</a>)及美光(<a data-ga-click-item=\"USS:MU:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/usstock/detail/MU\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">MU-US</a>)下跌4%至12%。艾司摩爾(<a data-ga-click-item=\"USS:ASML:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/usstock/detail/ASML\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">ASML-US</a>)(ASML-NL)歐股跌逾6%，台積電(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:2330:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/2330\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">2330-TW</a>)(<a data-ga-click-item=\"USS:TSM:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/usstock/detail/TSM\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">TSM-US</a>)台股跌近2%；戴爾(<a data-ga-click-item=\"USS:DELL:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/usstock/detail/DELL\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">DELL-US</a>)、慧與科技(<a data-ga-click-item=\"USS:HPE:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/usstock/detail/HPE\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">HPE-US</a>)及美超微(<a data-ga-click-item=\"USS:SMCI:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/usstock/detail/SMCI\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">SMCI-US</a>)則跌6%至11%。</p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\">\n</section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><h6>PC成本攀升 產能配置遭質疑</h6></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\">\n</section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>這波重挫前，英特爾今年股價已翻倍，去年也大漲逾80%。AI代理與聊天機器人推升中央處理器需求，加上晶圓代工布局取得進展，讓英特爾重新成為AI熱潮受惠者。</p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\">\n</section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>然而，擴建製造業務消耗大量現金，供應中斷又限制公司滿足資料中心晶片需求。占第三季營收約一半的PC晶片業務，也因記憶體供應商轉向AI使用的高頻寬記憶體，導致傳統記憶體漲價而承壓。</p></section><div class=\"ia49rhf\"></div><section style=\"margin-top:30px\">\n</section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>Seaport Research Partners分析師Jay Goldberg認為，賣壓反映市場對管理層失去信任。他批評，英特爾在15年來最差的PC市場生產過多消費型晶片，卻在半導體最強成長週期中，未能供應足夠AI伺服器晶片，問題出在規畫不當。</p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\">\n</section></main>",
            "link": "https://news.cnyes.com/news/id/6642655",
            "pub_date": "2026-10-31 01:30:03",
